            "answer": "<p>It's a sparkling seltz inspired by<em>seltz limone e sale</em>, carbonated water, lemon juice, and sea salt, served from kiosks in Catania, Sicily since 1896. Not a soda. Not a flavored water. Not really an electrolyte drink in the sports-supplement sense either. It's closer to a very old, very simple recipe than anything new.</p>"
