          "settings": {
            "question": "Why glass bottles instead of aluminum cans?",
            "answer": "<p>Most aluminum cans are lined with a polymer coating so that you don't get that metallic aftertaste.  Glass is inert and doesn't react with anything, so it needs no liner and adds no flavor of its own. It also holds carbonation tighter and stays cold longer in your hand.  We wanted to ensure the only the highest of quality for our consumers so they can experience Soletta as if they were in Catania themselves. </p>"
